# Per-crate Cargo.lock (cargo build artifacts when invoked in subdirs)
# Only the workspace-root Cargo.lock is tracked, plus the standalone
# soak-charts publisher crate's lock — its supply-chain pin (see its Cargo.toml).
Cargo.lock
!/Cargo.lock
!/scripts/soak-charts/Cargo.lock

